Package: lmmRRdiag
Type: Package
Title: Indexed Recursive Residual Diagnostics for Linear Mixed Models
Version: 0.2.3
Authors@R: c(
    person("Ahmed", "Bani-Mustafa", email = "a.mustafa@au.edu.kw", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Amjad D.", "Al-Nasser", role = "aut")
    )
Description: Research-companion implementation of indexed recursive residual
    diagnostics for Gaussian linear mixed models. The package computes marginal
    Cholesky recursive residuals for models fitted with lme4 (via
    rr_recursive_residuals_lmer()) or nlme (via rr_recursive_residuals_lme(),
    supporting R-side correlation structures such as CAR(1) and AR(1)), indexed
    cumulative residual processes (including the variance-standardised
    time-indexed CUSUM for unbalanced follow-up), scalar diagnostic
    summaries with closed-form first-order null reference bands, and
    refitting parametric-bootstrap p-values, including family-wise (min-p)
    calibration, for both model classes. It also contains
    reproducibility drivers for the empirical examples in the companion
    manuscript.
